WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:06,000
The corpse of the Immortal Dancer is here

2
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:08,510
It’s really a fairy

3
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,050
You killed them all

4
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:24,520
You can’t even practice

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,960
How about you try

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:35,890
Not even a trace of needle veins can be sensed

7
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,940
But this is the kind of person

8
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,380
Relying on the flesh forcibly

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,140
Killed two fairy dancers

10
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,640
It would be great if Li Dao could practice

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,840
After decades of hard training, he entered heaven

12
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:54,400
But he can't survive more than three weeks under my hand

13
00:00:55,250 --> 00:01:02,420
This speed is faster than any orthodox practice.

14
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:03,820
I'm too lazy to go
